abstract: >-
  Cello is an interactive biochemical cell simulator and research-oriented
  visualization platform for Windows x64. Version 2.1 adds Spatial Biology and
  cell-specific pathway views while preserving the v2 kinetic core.
keywords:
  - biochemistry
  - cell simulation
  - systems biology
  - scientific visualization
  - spatial biology
  - pathway visualization
  - computational biology
